# ==============================================================================
# KAEDE - AgentHub Bot Configuration
# ==============================================================================
# This configuration is for the dedicated AgentHub Bot.
# The AgentHub Bot does NOT process normal conversation messages and does NOT
# require any AI provider credentials (like COPILOT_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, etc.).
# It only registers and handles administrative slash commands (e.g. /clear, /restart).
# To run this bot, use `npm run agenthub`.
# ==============================================================================

# Required: The Discord Bot Token specifically for the AgentHub
DISCORD_BOT_TOKEN="your_agenthub_bot_token_here"

# Note: No AGENT_NAME, AGENT_PROVIDER, or API keys are required here.
